README.md
CLAUDE.md
docs/
*.md

# CI/CD
.gitlab-ci.yml
.github/

# Test reports
**/test-results/
**/jacoco/
**/reports/

# Logs
*.log
logs/
/tmp/

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Environment files
.env
.env.local
*.env

# Firebase credentials (security)
**/firebase/firebase-adminsdk.json

# Temporary files
*.tmp
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Spring Boot DevTools
**/spring-boot-devtools.properties
